text @[Tomoya]
text No...
text @[Tomoya]
text I was born with this sullen face...
text @[Tomoya]
text This makes anyone who talks to me feel uneasy.
text @[Tomoya]
text And I may have even hurt {$lnmA}'s feelings with this without knowing...
